entries[128531] = { ["name"] = "Blackout Kick", ["text"] = "Unlimited range\nInstant\nKick with a blast of Chi energy, dealing [7.12 * ( 1 * ( 1 * 1 * ( 0.898882 * (Mainhand Min DPS * [0.75] 1 + 0 ) + (Attack Power / 14) - 1)))] to [7.12 * ( 1 * ( 1 * 1 * ( 0.898882 * (Mainhand Max DPS * [0.75] 1 + 0 ) + (Attack Power / 14) + 1)))] Physical damage [ Teachings of the Monastery : to your target and [3.56 * ( 1 * ( 1 * 1 * ( 0.898882 * (Mainhand Min DPS * [0.75] 1 + 0 ) + (Attack Power / 14) - 1)))] to [3.56 * ( 1 * ( 1 * 1 * ( 0.898882 * (Mainhand Max DPS * [0.75] 1 + 0 ) + (Attack Power / 14) + 1)))] to up to 4 additional nearby targets ]. [ Combat Conditioning : If behind the target, you deal an additional 20% damage over 4 sec. If in front of the target, you are instantly healed for 20% of the damage done ] [ Brewmaster Training : Also causes you to gain Shuffle, increasing your parry chance by 20% and your Stagger amount by an additional 20% for 6 sec ] [ Teachings of the Monastery : Also empowers you with Serpent's Zeal, causing you and your summoned Jade Serpent Statue to heal nearby injured targets equal to 25% of your auto-attack damage.\n\nCaster weapons deal increased damage ]" }
